{"id":"083646086ee2d9dc","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-cat-example.md","title":"Category Theory Examples","display":"df-cat-example — Category Theory Examples","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-cat-example","aliases":["58-df-cat-example"],"display":"df-cat-example — Category Theory Examples","depends_on":["[[58-df-category]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-cat-example"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-cat-example</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-cat-example — Category Theory Examples"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a87b7e1119b63b2c\" href=\"?note=a87b7e1119b63b2c\" title=\"58-df-category\">58-df-category</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C,\\mathcal E\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal E\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Category}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Category}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (small-category predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a87b7e1119b63b2c\" href=\"?note=a87b7e1119b63b2c\" title=\"58-df-category\">58-df-category</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CatExample}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{CatExample}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (set-sized catalogue predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cat\\text{-}example} \\vdash \\mathrm{CatExample}_S(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal E)\\leftrightarrow\\mathcal E\\in V\\land\\mathcal C\\in\\mathcal E\\land\\forall\\mathcal D\\in\\mathcal E\\;\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal D)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cat\\text{-}example} \\vdash \\mathrm{CatExample}_S(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal E)\\leftrightarrow\\mathcal E\\in V\\land\\mathcal C\\in\\mathcal E\\land\\forall\\mathcal D\\in\\mathcal E\\;\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal D)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> is a set-sized catalogue of set-coded small categories.</li>\n<li>The large categories of all sets, groups, topological spaces, vector spaces, or topoi are definable classes rather than elements of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> and therefore are not values of this predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"a87b7e1119b63b2c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"a87b7e1119b63b2c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Category}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (small-category predicate, see [[58-df-category]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C,\\mathcal E\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Category}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CatExample}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cat\\text{-}example} \\vdash \\mathrm{CatExample}_S(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal E)\\leftrightarrow\\mathcal E\\in V\\land\\mathcal C\\in\\mathcal E\\land\\forall\\mathcal D\\in\\mathcal E\\;\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal D)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false}],"bytes":1021,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-244","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-cat-example.md|58-df-cat-example]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["a87b7e1119b63b2c"]}